==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 4.33 seconds<sup>130f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]] with the Target [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] [[Talents|Talent]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] are needed to halt the advances of the Relic Bun-Buns or kill the Mooths quickly, respectively. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Mystic Uril]] or [[Medusa Cat (Rare Cat)|Twintail Medusa Cat]] function well as additional crowd-control for the Relic Bun-Buns, with the former being a great DPS as well.

==Trivia==
*"Khao Man Guys" is a pun on ''[[wikipedia:Hainanese chicken rice#Thailand|Khao man gai]]'', a Thai street food chicken dish.

